// input: after idr-defunctionalize
// FILECHECK-OPTIONS: --implicit-check-not=idr.closure --implicit-check-not=idr.apply
// rule: ELIM-CLOS-1, ELIM-G-7, IDR-WORLD-1, TEST-ELIM-1
// countdown returns an action, and calls itself inside it: the actions'
// closures cannot all be inlined away, since countdown is recursive, but
// the set of their labels is finite, so idr-defunctionalize turns them into
// a sum over the labels and each idr.apply into a match (ELIM-G-5, arity
// raising, is withdrawn). No closure is left, and the output is fused.
// CHECK-DAG: idr.io.put_int
// CHECK-DAG: idr.constant "liftoff\0A"
